            <title>Resolving Anaconda Spyder Unresponsive Click Issue</title>
            <link>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/spyderfix/</link>
            <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2020 16:03:00 +0800</pubDate>
            <guid>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/spyderfix/</guid>
            <description>&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translation Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;This article was machine-translated using DeepSeek-R1.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Original Version&lt;/strong&gt;: Authored in Chinese by myself&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accuracy Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Potential discrepancies may exist between translations&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precedence&lt;/strong&gt;: The Chinese text shall prevail in case of ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;: Technical suggestions regarding translation quality are welcomed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;problem-analysis&#34;&gt;Problem Analysis&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Possible issues with package upgrades or uninstallations related to &lt;code&gt;spyder&lt;/code&gt; dependencies.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;After upgrading &lt;code&gt;PyQt5&lt;/code&gt; to version &lt;code&gt;5.15&lt;/code&gt;, conflicts occurred since &lt;code&gt;spyder&lt;/code&gt; requires &lt;code&gt;PyQt5&amp;lt;5.13&lt;/code&gt;, causing startup failures.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;solution&#34;&gt;Solution&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open &lt;code&gt;Anaconda Prompt&lt;/code&gt; and execute:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-c&#34; data-lang=&#34;c&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;pip&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;spyder&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explanation:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;code&gt;pip&lt;/code&gt; automatically installs dependency-compatible packages. For example, when installing &lt;code&gt;spyder&lt;/code&gt; (which requires &lt;code&gt;PyQt5&amp;lt;5.13&lt;/code&gt;), &lt;code&gt;pip&lt;/code&gt; detects the installed &lt;code&gt;PyQt5 5.15&lt;/code&gt; and downgrades to the highest compatible version (&lt;code&gt;PyQt5 5.12.3&lt;/code&gt;, the latest version below &lt;code&gt;5.13&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;20210923 EDIT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;If encountering &amp;ldquo;Access Denied&amp;rdquo; errors, add the &lt;code&gt;--user&lt;/code&gt; option.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>How to Solve Slow Eclipse Installation Package Downloads</title>
            <link>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/eclipseinstmirrors/</link>
            <pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2020 19:48:00 +0800</pubDate>
            <guid>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/eclipseinstmirrors/</guid>
            <description>&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translation Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;This article was machine-translated using DeepSeek-R1.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Original Version&lt;/strong&gt;: Authored in Chinese by myself&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accuracy Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Potential discrepancies may exist between translations&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precedence&lt;/strong&gt;: The Chinese text shall prevail in case of ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;: Technical suggestions regarding translation quality are welcomed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Recently started learning &lt;code&gt;Java&lt;/code&gt; and using the classic &lt;code&gt;Eclipse IDE&lt;/code&gt;, but found the download speed too slow&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;problem-analysis&#34;&gt;Problem Analysis&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;432px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;180&#34; height=&#34;789&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/1.png&#34; srcset=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/1_hu_2dbfcdd39bb8b488.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/1.png 1422w&#34; width=&#34;1422&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Eclipse&lt;/code&gt; downloads rely on third-party mirrors, which (on my machine) default to a North Korean mirror (defaults may vary across devices):&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;432px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;180&#34; height=&#34;789&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/2.png&#34; srcset=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/2_hu_586c3f8fd9954885.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/2.png 1422w&#34; width=&#34;1422&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;code&gt;Select Another Mirror&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;432px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;180&#34; height=&#34;789&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/3.png&#34; srcset=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/3_hu_ebd79975ba0be59e.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/3.png 1422w&#34; width=&#34;1422&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Select a Chinese mirror:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img alt=&#34;Solution&#34; class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;311px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;129&#34; height=&#34;592&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseinstmirrors/4.png&#34; width=&#34;768&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item><item>
            <title>Eclipse Check For Updates Always Fails to Find Updates - Solution</title>
            <link>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/eclipseupdmirror/</link>
            <pubDate>Wed, 08 Apr 2020 22:12:00 +0800</pubDate>
            <guid>https://goodcoder666.github.io/en/p/eclipseupdmirror/</guid>
            <description>&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translation Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;This article was machine-translated using DeepSeek-R1.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Original Version&lt;/strong&gt;: Authored in Chinese by myself&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accuracy Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Potential discrepancies may exist between translations&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precedence&lt;/strong&gt;: The Chinese text shall prevail in case of ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;: Technical suggestions regarding translation quality are welcomed&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Recently tried to update &lt;code&gt;Eclipse&lt;/code&gt; using the &lt;code&gt;Help -&amp;gt; Check For Updates&lt;/code&gt; feature in this popular &lt;code&gt;Java IDE&lt;/code&gt;, but it always reports no updates found:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img alt=&#34;No Updates Found illustration&#34; class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;812px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;338&#34; height=&#34;153&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/1.png&#34; width=&#34;518&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;check-for-available-updates&#34;&gt;Check for Available Updates&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;First, visit the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.eclipse.org/eclipseide/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xD;&#xA;    &gt;Eclipse Download Page&lt;/a&gt; to get the latest version (currently 2020-06):&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img alt=&#34;2020-06&#34; class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;347px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;144&#34; height=&#34;823&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/2.png&#34; srcset=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/2_hu_c0fa778fdc8771ee.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/2.png 1191w&#34; width=&#34;1191&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Then check your local Eclipse version (&lt;code&gt;Help -&amp;gt; About Eclipse IDE&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img alt=&#34;Go to Help&#34; class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;194px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;80&#34; height=&#34;410&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/3.png&#34; width=&#34;332&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;version&#34; class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;373px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;155&#34; height=&#34;450&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/4.png&#34; width=&#34;701&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If the online version matches your current version (as shown), then &lt;code&gt;System.exit(0);&lt;/code&gt;&amp;hellip; Don&amp;rsquo;t blame Eclipse unnecessarily&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;fix-detection-failure-when-updates-exist&#34;&gt;Fix Detection Failure When Updates Exist&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open the &amp;ldquo;Available Software Sites&amp;rdquo; window:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;336px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;140&#34; height=&#34;555&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/5.png&#34; width=&#34;777&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Method 1: Click the &amp;ldquo;available software sites&amp;rdquo; link in the prompt window:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;812px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;338&#34; height=&#34;153&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/6.png&#34; width=&#34;518&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Method 2: Navigate to &lt;code&gt;Window -&amp;gt; Prefrences -&amp;gt; Install/Update -&amp;gt; available software sites&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;200px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;83&#34; height=&#34;199&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/7.png&#34; width=&#34;166&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Locate &lt;code&gt;Latest Eclipse Release&lt;/code&gt;, check the red-dotted entry, click &lt;code&gt;Apply and Close&lt;/code&gt;, then recheck updates.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;375px&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;156&#34; height=&#34;555&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px&#34; src=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/8.png&#34; srcset=&#34;https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/8_hu_74d7aa08417f93c5.png 800w, https://goodcoder666.github.io/p/eclipseupdmirror/8.png 869w&#34; width=&#34;869&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
        </item></channel>
